Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:30.53,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&H247EB8&\blur4}若是乖乖聽話 笑容會綻放嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:35.20,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HDD2BAA&\blur4}所以為什麼向死而行
